    ($SATQ$7a6d06bf$SATQ$, $SATQ$6e108e29-0eee-4507-8a4a-45c4b2c82383$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.C.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Nonlinear functions$SATQ$, $SATQ$H$SATQ$, 6, $SATQ$spr$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">A rectangle has an area of <math alttext="155"><mn>155</mn>
</math> square inches. The length of the rectangle is <math alttext="4"><mn>4</mn>
</math> inches less than <math alttext="7"><mn>7</mn>
</math> times the width of the rectangle. What is the width of the rectangle, in inches?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["5"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["5"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The correct answer is <math alttext="5"><mn>5</mn>
