<p style="text-align: left;">During the second part of the experiment, the ball was launched the same way, but from a platform that is <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math> feet shorter than the first platform. Which of the following graphs could represent the height <math alttext="y"><mi>y</mi>
</math>, in feet, of the ball <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
