math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"24\"><mn>24</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> in the equation <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis x plus 14 right parenthesis left parenthesis t minus x right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> yields <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis x plus 14 right parenthesis left parenthesis 24 minus x right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. The value of <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math> can be calculated by substituting <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in this equation, which yields <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals left parenthesis 0 plus 14 right parenthesis left parenthesis 24 minus 0 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, or&nbsp;<math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals 336\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>336</mn></math>.</p>","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> is defined by <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis x plus 14 right parenthesis left parenthesis t minus x right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></m